project project cases [] design  start 
style spacing  default StyleSpec { Stroke = , StrokeWidth = , Corner = , Pattern = , Fill = , IsEmpty = True }
circuit storageHeader 100 water neutral Static
component AHU_NETWORK outlet in storageHeader at  tag  style 
  flow = 0.08 MassFlow  
component RAD_NETWORK outlet in storageHeader at  tag  style 
  flow = 0.12 MassFlow  
component S1 inlet in storageHeader at  tag  style 
  flow = 0.12 MassFlow  
  t = 333.15 Temperature  
component S2 inlet in storageHeader at  tag  style 
  flow = 0.08 MassFlow  
  t = 318.15 Temperature  
component T1 tank in storageHeader at  tag 100S01 style 
  in1_level = 0.9 Dimensionless  
  in2_level = 0.3 Dimensionless  
  layers = 5 Dimensionless  
  out1_level = 0.9 Dimensionless  
  out2_level = 0.3 Dimensionless  
  t1 = 298.15 Temperature  
  t2 = 303.15 Temperature  
  t3 = 313.15 Temperature  
  t4 = 323.15 Temperature  
  t5 = 333.15 Temperature  
  volume = 0.3 Volume  
component TE_AHU t_sensor in storageHeader at AHU_NETWORK tag 100TE04 style 
component TE_RAD t_sensor in storageHeader at RAD_NETWORK tag 100TE03 style 
component TE_S1 t_sensor in storageHeader at S1 tag 100TE01 style 
component TE_S2 t_sensor in storageHeader at S2 tag 100TE02 style 
connection S1. -> T1.in1
connection S2. -> T1.in2
connection T1.out1 -> RAD_NETWORK.
connection T1.out2 -> AHU_NETWORK.
show [temperature] scale 
